  epo:hasChangeReasonDescription """Section 2.1.4 General information, Additional information of the contract notice reads \"An estimated contract value is indicated in Section II.2.6 of the contract notice.\". It is wrong and is amended to read \"An estimated contract value is indicated in Section 2.1.3 of the contract notice.\"
